      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 800,
      "height": 260,
      "seed": 467230,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    A[Launch] --> B[Permission Check]\n    B -->|All granted| C[HomeScreen]\n    B -->|Missing| D[Request Permissions] --> B\n\n    C -->|Tap| TabCalls[Calls Tab] --> CallsScreen[Calls List + Reddet]\n    C -->|Tap| TabSMS[SMS Tab] --> SmsScreen[SMS List + Yanıtla]\n    C -->|Tap| TabSettings[Settings Tab] --> SettingsScreen\n\n    SettingsScreen --> QRInfo[QR & Peer Info]\n    SettingsScreen --> BatteryOpt[Battery‑Opt‑Out Button]\n    SettingsScreen --> Reset[Reset Device → New QR]\n```",
      "baseline": 22,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "```mermaid\ngraph LR\n    A[Launch] --> B[Permission Check]\n    B -->|All granted| C[HomeScreen]\n    B -->|Missing| D[Request Permissions] --> B\n\n    C -->|Tap| TabCalls[Calls Tab] --> CallsScreen[Calls List + Reddet]\n    C -->|Tap| TabSMS[SMS Tab] --> SmsScreen[SMS List + Yanıtla]\n    C -->|Tap| TabSettings[Settings Tab] --> SettingsScreen\n\n    SettingsScreen --> QRInfo[QR & Peer Info]\n    SettingsScreen --> BatteryOpt[Battery‑Opt‑Out Button]\n    SettingsScreen --> Reset[Reset Device → New QR]\n```"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 141,
      "id": "pairing-diagram",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 800,
      "height": 300,
      "seed": 192847,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant UI as Flutter UI\n    participant QR as QR Generator\n    participant Keystore as Secure Storage\n    participant Net as Network (mDNS/Socket)\n\n    UI->>QR: Generate 256‑bit key + IP → QR bitmap\n    QR-->>UI: Show QR\n    UI->>Keystore: Store key securely\n    UI->>Net: Advertise own service (mDNS) + IP\n\n    alt Other device scans QR\n        OtherDevice->>QR: Scan bitmap\n        QR-->>OtherDevice: Decode JSON {key, ip}\n        OtherDevice->>Keystore: Save partner key\n        OtherDevice->>Net: Connect to advertised IP (TCP socket)\n    else Manual entry (fallback)\n        OtherDevice->>UI: Enter IP & key\n    end\n\n    UI->>UI: Show Role Picker (Main / Source)\n    UI->>Net: Open socket, exchange “role” message\n    Net-->>UI: ACK role\n```",
      "baseline": 22,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 141,
      "id": "call-flow-diagram",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 650,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 800,
      "height": 260,
      "seed": 574321,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph SourceDevice\n        PhoneState[PhoneStateReceiver] --> EncryptCall[Encrypt (AES‑GCM)]\n        EncryptCall --> SocketSend[Send TCP packet]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Network\n        SocketSend -->|TCP| SocketReceive[Socket (Main)]\n    end\n\n    subgraph MainDevice\n        SocketReceive --> DecryptCall[Decrypt]\n        DecryptCall --> HeadsUp[Show Heads‑up Notification]\n        HeadsUp -->|User taps “Reddet\"| RejectCmd[Encrypt Reject Command]\n        RejectCmd --> SocketSendBack[Send TCP back]\n        SocketSendBack --> PhoneStateEnd[PhoneStateReceiver.endCall()]\n    end\n```",
      "baseline": 22,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 141,
      "id": "sms-flow-diagram",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 950,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 800,
      "height": 340,
      "seed": 837452,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Source as Source Phone (SMS Receiver)\n    participant Main as Main Phone (UI)\n    participant Net as TCP Socket\n    participant DB as SQLite (Queue)\n\n    Source->>Source: SmsReceiver captures inbound SMS\n    Source->>Source: Encrypt payload\n    Source->>Net: Send encrypted packet\n\n    Net->>Main: Deliver packet\n    Main->>Main: Decrypt & store in DB\n    Main->>Main: UI updates (new SMS card)\n\n    alt User replies from Main\n        Main->>Main: User writes reply → Encrypt\n        Main->>Net: Send reply packet\n        Net->>Source: Deliver reply\n        Source->>Source: SmsManager.sendTextMessage()\n        Source->>Source: Ack status (sent/failed)\n        Source->>Net: Ack packet\n        Net->>Main: Update status in DB\n    end\n```",
      "baseline": 22,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 141,
      "id": "offline-queue-diagram",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1320,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 800,
      "height": 250,
      "seed": 617894,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph Device (any role)\n        Conn[ConnectivityListener] -->|Online| Sync[Sync Queue → Socket]\n        Conn -->|Offline| Queue[Insert into offline_queue DB]\n\n        Queue -->|Retry on reconnect| Sync\n    end\n\n    Sync -->|Success| Delete[Delete processed rows]\n    Sync -->|Fail| Retry[Increment retryCount & backoff]\n```",
      "baseline": 22,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 141,
      "id": "battery-opt-out-diagram",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1600,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 800,
      "height": 220,
      "seed": 239761,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    SettingsScreen --> BatteryBtn[“Pil Optimizasyonunu Kaldır”]\n    BatteryBtn --> AndroidIntent[Launch ACTION_REQUEST_IGNORE_BATTERY_OPTIMIZATIONS]\n    AndroidIntent -->|User OK| Toast[Show “İzin verildi”]\n    AndroidIntent -->|User Denied| Toast[Show “İzin reddedildi”]\n```",
      "baseline": 22,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 141,
      "id": "reset-diagram",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1860,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 800,
      "height": 260,
      "seed": 845331,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant UI as Settings UI\n    participant DB as SQLite\n    participant KS as SecureStorage\n    participant QR as QR Generator\n\n    UI->>DB: deleteAll()   // temizle tüm call/sms/queue\n    UI->>KS: delete(key)   // kaldır AES‑256 anahtar\n    UI->>QR: generate new key + IP → QR bitmap\n    QR-->>UI: Show new QR (user must scan from partner)\n    UI->>UI: Show toast “Cihaz sıfırlandı, yeni QR taratın”\n```",
      "baseline": 22,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 141,
      "id": "highlevel-diagram",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2160,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 800,
      "height": 340,
      "seed": 389472,
      "groupIds": [],
      "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "```mermaid\ngraph TB\n    subgraph A[Device A – Source]\n        A1[PhoneStateReceiver] --> A2[Encrypt (AES‑GCM)]\n        A3[SmsReceiver] --> A2\n        A2 --> A4[Socket (TCP)]\n    end\n\n    subgraph B[Device B – Main]\n        B1[Socket Listener] --> B2[Decrypt]\n        B2 --> B3[UI Update (Call / SMS List)]\n        B3 --> B4[Show Notification (Heads‑up / SnackBar)]\n        B4 --> B5[User Action (Reddet / Yanıtla)]\n        B5 --> B6[Encrypt Response] --> B7[Socket Back]\n    end\n\n    A4 --> B1\n    B7 --> A1\n\n    %% Connectivity & Offline\n    A4 -.->|offline| A8[Queue DB] -.->|reconnect| A4\n    B1 -.->|offline| B8[Queue DB] -.->|reconnect| B1\n\n    %% Pairing\n    A0[QR Generator] --> A0a[Show QR] --> A0b[Partner scans]\n    B0[QR Scanner] --> B0a[Decode PeerInfo] --> B0b[Store key+ip]\n\n    %% Settings\n    Settings --> BatteryOpt[Ignore Battery Optimizations]\n    Settings --> Reset[Delete DB & Key + New QR]\n\n    %% High‑Level System\n    Settings --> QRInfo[QR & Peer Info]\n    Settings --> BatteryOpt\n    Settings --> Reset\n```",
      "baseline": 22,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
